        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7036/L, 4-1/2 Rectangular Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4-1/2 Inch Pocket Door Privacy Set is operated by turning a thumbturn on the interior to throw the mortise bolt. As a privacy sliding door lock, the bolt can be retracted from the exterior via the emergency release turn. The 4-1/2 Rectangular Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Set comes packaged with 2 flush pulls, a privacy mortise box, and the installation hardware. Choose from a wide array of attractive finishes.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/4-1-2-inch-rectangular-flush-pull-omnia-7036-0\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 7036 Pocket Door Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Case: Stamped from heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Front: Armored steel front adjustable for beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Privacy Modern Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 1/2\" thick x 1-1/4\" high x 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Finger Pull: 1/2\" thick x 2\" high x 1-1/4\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-7036-specifications.pdf?v=1704262370\"><b>Omnia 7036 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a privacy mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4-1/2 Inch Pocket Door Privacy Set",
                "description": "The 4-1/2 Inch Pocket Door Privacy Set is operated by turning a thumbturn on the interior to throw the mortise bolt. As a privacy sliding door lock, the bolt can be retracted from the exterior via the emergency release turn. The 4-1/2 Rectangular Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Set comes packaged with 2 flush pulls, a privacy mortise box, and the installation hardware. Choose from a wide array of attractive finishes.",
